            "text": "第Ⅰ問　4次式は因数分解の形を先に見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(a)",
                "text": "アイ 11 ／ ウエ 16 ／ オ 1 ／ カキ −5 ／ ク 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "(b)",
                "text": "ケ 2 ／ コ 3 ／ サシ 20 ／ スセ 13 ／ ソ 7"
              },
              {
                "label": "(c)",
                "text": "タ 1 ／ チ 3 ／ ツ 5 ／ テ 9 ／ トナ 10 ／ ニ 9 ／ ヌ 2 ／ ネノ 27"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01",
            "style": "values"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "進め方",
            "text": "(b)は独立して短く、最初の得点源です。(a)の増減表、(c)の係数比較は式を丁寧に並べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(a) 増減表から水平線との交点数を読む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=6x(x+1)(2x-1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "極値はx=−1,0,1/2で起こります。値を代入し、水平線y=kが4点で交わる高さを読みます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{11}{16}<k<1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-i-quartic-graphs",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "k=11/16ではx=1/2が重解です。残る2根をp,qとして因数分解し、x³の係数を比べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "3x^4+2x^3-3x^2+\\frac5{16}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=3\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)^2(x-p)(x-q)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p+q=-\\frac53",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(b) 共役を使って実係数二次式を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(x+1)^2+2=x^2+2x+3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "f(x)をこの二次式で割った余りは20x+13です。x=√2i−1を代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(\\sqrt2i-1)=-7+20\\sqrt2i",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(c) 二重根2組を展開する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)-(ax+b)=3(x-\\alpha)^2(x-\\beta)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "x³、x²、x、定数項を順に比較します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha+\\beta=-\\frac13",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha\\beta=-\\frac59",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a=\\frac{10}{9},\\qquad b=\\frac{2}{27}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅱ問　x=0の左右を別々にそろえる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(a)",
                "text": "ア 0"
              },
              {
                "label": "(b)",
                "text": "イ 3 ／ ウ 1 ／ エ 3 ／ オ 3 ／ カキ −2 ／ ク 3 ／ ケコ −2"
              },
              {
                "label": "(c)",
                "text": "サシ −2 ／ ス 3 ／ セ 1 ／ ソ 3 ／ タ 2 ／ チ 6 ／ ツ 3 ／ テ 5 ／ ト 3 ／ ナ 1 ／ ニ 5 ／ ヌ 2"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02",
            "style": "values"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(a) 与えられた不等式を積の極限へ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\tan x-\\sin x}{x^2}<\\frac{x-\\sin x}{x^2}<0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\tan x-\\sin x}{x^2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\tan x\\left(\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\right)^2\\frac1{1+\\cos x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "左端が0へ近づき右端も0なので、はさみうちで答えは0です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{x\\to0-}\\frac{x-\\sin x}{x^2}=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(b) まず連続条件からbを決める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{x\\to0+}f(x)=\\frac b3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{x\\to0-}f(x)=1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b=3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "右側を微分すると、b=3のとき次の形です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=\\frac{-3x+9a}{(x^2+9)^{3/2}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{x\\to0+}f'(x)=\\frac a3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "左側も微分し、(a)の極限を使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{x\\to0-}f'(x)=-\\frac23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "左右の導関数を一致させるとa=−2です。平均値の定理でf'(0)の存在も確認します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac a3=-\\frac23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a=-2,\\qquad f'(0)=-\\frac23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "微分可能性の注意",
            "text": "導関数の片側極限が一致するだけでは、一般にf'(0)の存在は自動ではありません。原本は平均値の定理または差商で確認しています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}x=-\\frac23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(c) 接線との正の交点を先に決める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=-\\frac23x+1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "x>0で接線とf(x)を等置し、x=0以外の交点を選びます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "u=\\frac32",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "0≤x≤3/2では右側の式を積分します。分子を−2xと3に分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^{3/2}f(x)\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\int_0^{3/2}\\frac{-2x}{\\sqrt{x^2+9}}\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "+\\int_0^{3/2}\\frac3{\\sqrt{x^2+9}}\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "第1項は置換なしで積分し、第2項はx=3tanθと置きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^{3/2}f(x)\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=6-3\\sqrt5+3\\log_e\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-ii-triangle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "第Ⅱ問の確認",
            "text": "連続条件b=3、微分条件a=−2、正の交点u=3/2の順に固定してから積分します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅲ問　立体は断面、確率は状態をまとめる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "text": "ア 2 ／ イ 8 ／ ウエ −8 ／ オ 8 ／ カ 8 ／ キ 3 ／ ク 2 ／ ケ 2 ／ コ 1 ／ サ 2 ／ シ 2 ／ ス 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "text": "セ 1 ／ ソ 3 ／ タ 1 ／ チ 6 ／ ツ 5 ／ テト 32 ／ ナ 2 ／ ニ 1 ／ ヌ 6 ／ ネ 2 ／ ノ 9"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03",
            "style": "values"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 直交円柱の共通部分を座標で見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y^2+z^2\\le1,\\qquad z^2+x^2\\le1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p011",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "境界Lでは2式の差からy=±xです。xy平面とz軸との交点を求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A(1,1,0),\\ B(-1,1,0)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C(-1,-1,0),\\ D(1,-1,0)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "E(0,0,1),\\ F(0,0,-1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Aを通る楕円の半径は√2と1なので面積は√2πです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt2\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-xy-coordinates",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-a-ellipse",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p012",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "x軸から距離1の境界を展開する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "対称性から第1象限・z≥0の部分を求め、8倍します。展開図では幅θ、高さcosθです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "8\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta=8",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-solid-projection",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-projection-development",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p013",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "z=tで切ると正方形の差",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "円柱共通部の断面は一辺2√(1−t²)、八面体の断面は一辺2(1−|t|)の正方形です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S_t=\\{2\\sqrt{1-t^2}\\}^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-\\{2(1-|t|)\\}^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-octahedron-section",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p014",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S_t=-8t^2+8|t|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "偶関数なので0から1まで積分して2倍します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=2\\int_0^1(-8t^2+8t)\\,dt",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=\\frac83",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-z-section-square",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-x-section-circle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p015",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "x=uの断面を円から六角形分だけ引く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "u=cosθと置くと、円柱共通部の円内から八面体の六角形を除いた面積を整理できます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=2\\theta+\\sin2\\theta+\\cos2\\theta-1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-x-section-area",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p016",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{dS}{d\\theta}=2+2\\cos2\\theta-2\\sin2\\theta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "0<θ<π/2で増減を調べるとθ=π/4で最大です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "u=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S_{\\max}=\\frac\\pi2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-iii-cylinder-note",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) EとFだけを別状態にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p017",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "n秒後にEにいる確率をp_n、Fにいる確率をq_nとします。残り4頂点にいる確率は1−p_n−q_nです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_{n+1}=\\frac13(1-p_n-q_n)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "q_{n+1}=\\frac16(1-p_n-q_n)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "和r_n=p_n+q_nを取ると1本の漸化式になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r_{n+1}=\\frac12(1-r_n)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p018",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "xy平面上の4頂点は対称なので、各頂点の確率は同じです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=\\frac14\\{1-(p_n+q_n)\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=\\frac1{12}\\left\\{2+\\left(-\\frac12\\right)^{n-1}\\right\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "n=4を代入するとAにいる確率は5/32です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_4=\\frac5{32}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Fの確率q_nも漸化式から一般項を作ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p019",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "q_n=\\frac1{18}\\left\\{2+\\left(-\\frac12\\right)^{n-2}\\right\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "奇数・偶数に分けると、最大はn=2のときと分かります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "q_2=\\frac16",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "同様にp_nの一般項を求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_n=\\frac19\\left\\{2+\\left(-\\frac12\\right)^{n-2}\\right\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kyorin-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p020",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "交代項は0へ収束するので、p_nの極限は2/9です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}p_n=\\frac29",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "70分の使い方",
